{"id":"inesperado","lemma":"inesperado","pos":"adj","rank":3752,"glosses":["unexpected"],"ipa":"/inespeˈɾado/","forms":{"feminine":"inesperada","masculinePlural":"inesperados","femininePlural":"inesperadas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-inesperado.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ocurrió algo inesperado.","en":"Something unexpected happened.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355362","words":[{"g":"to happen, to occur","l":"ocurrir"},{"g":"something, anything"},null]},{"text":"Eso es bastante inesperado.","en":"That is rather unexpected.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598129","words":[null,null,{"g":"quite"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"that's it"]]},{"text":"Recibí algunos regalos inesperados.","en":"I received some unexpected gifts.","words":[{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"someone","l":"alguno"},{"g":"present, gift","l":"regalo"},null]},{"text":"Nos encontramos con una dificultad inesperada.","en":"We met with an unexpected difficulty.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705540","words":[{"g":"us"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"difficulty"},null]},{"text":"Anunciaron resultados inesperados.","en":"Unexpected results were announced.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/707797","words":[{"g":"to announce","l":"anunciar"},{"g":"result","l":"resultado"},null]}]}